  "collectionNotes": [
    "真实客体LX6指令经SCCB寄存器配置传感器，LEDC经GPIO27提供XCLK；GPIO15硬件RESET、DVP GPIO矩阵与I2S0 DMA描述符共同决定客体DRAM中的RGB565/YUV422或外部编码JPEG字节。",
    "partial：数字相机子集使用约10Hz帧/1ms VSYNC近似调度，不模拟光学、曝光/ISP、JPEG编码器、逐PCLK时序、真实RF或电池/PoE模拟电气。未实机验证；出厂固件兼容性未由寄存器/DMA测试推断。",
    "JPEG必须由使用者提供与传感器SCCB配置尺寸一致的完整JPEG，按原字节进入客体；RGB图片不会冒充传感器编码JPEG，预览不会代替客体DMA输出。",
    "No physical device, factory firmware execution or calibrated1:1 photographic acceptance in this batch.",
    "Original photographs are M5Stack copyright, not relicensed under the repository MIT license.",
    "Geometry explicitly marked image-measurement is an exterior approximation; connector depths, internal board-space and hidden component dimensions are estimates.",
